& [UnresolvedTerms] remain open for SJS processing
  + [weight] may mean typed lexical relevance graph proximity contextual applicability evidence confidence risk or learned proposal score and must not be collapsed prematurely
  + [neural] may mean the shape of the semantic graph learned candidate routing or an actual trained artifact
  + [file_line] is a human locator while stable semantic identity content digest package digest clause identity and source-span digest carry machine authority
  + [proper_noun] is one strong naming signal and not the complete class of semantic identities
  + [verb] may denote relation observation inference transformation control capability or effect and requires class-specific constraints
  + [self_feeding] may mean bounded staged retrieval and procedure selection and must not imply autonomous authority growth

